DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaddmmllcc driver provides support for the Analog Devices ADM1024 tempera‐
     ture sensor.  The device possesses internal and external temperature sen‐
     sors, a variety of voltage sensors, plus two fan RPM monitors.  These
     values are made available through the sysctl(8) interface.

